### Variables
@API_URL = http://localhost:8080
@USER_TOKEN = {{USER_TOKEN_V2}}
@HUB_TOKEN = {{HUB_TOKEN_V2}}

###
# SETUP: Run 04-auth-v2.http (Register/Login) first.
# Run 06-insert-with-v2-hub.http to ensure sensor-01 has data.
# USER_TOKEN_V2 and HUB_TOKEN_V2 are captured automatically.

###
# GetLast - happy path
# Returns the single most recent raw reading for the probe.
POST {{API_URL}}/garden.v2.GardenService/GetLast HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{USER_TOKEN}}

{
  "node_id": "sensor-01"
}

###
# GetLast - probe with no data or not owned by user (should fail: NotFound)
POST {{API_URL}}/garden.v2.GardenService/GetLast HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{USER_TOKEN}}

{
  "node_id": "probe-that-does-not-exist"
}

###
# GetLast - empty node_id (should fail: InvalidArgument)
POST {{API_URL}}/garden.v2.GardenService/GetLast HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{USER_TOKEN}}

{
  "node_id": ""
}

###
# GetLast - hub token (should fail: PermissionDenied)
# Only user JWTs are allowed; service-account (hub) tokens are rejected.
POST {{API_URL}}/garden.v2.GardenService/GetLast HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{HUB_TOKEN}}

{
  "node_id": "sensor-01"
}

###
# GetLast - no auth (should fail: Unauthenticated)
POST {{API_URL}}/garden.v2.GardenService/GetLast HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "node_id": "sensor-01"
}
